# Responses rollout: configure OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-6-luna, apply prisma:deploy,
# run prisma:generate and build, then restart the backend (see README).
# Each test turn must use a new provider message ID. The same ID is deduplicated.
# These webhook requests can send real WhatsApp. For an isolated API test use:
# pnpm responses:smoke

### Twilio incoming message
POST http://localhost:4000/webhooks/whatsapp/twilio
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

From=whatsapp:+5215512345678&Body=Hola%20quiero%20apoyo%20fiscal&MessageSid=SM_TEST_001
